# LedgerMind OS — Flutter POS Environment
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values from your Supabase project.

# Supabase
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...

# Paystack (public key only)
